 For `openai-codex/*` models, the extension preserves the built-in Codex transport and only injects reconstructed remote compaction history after compaction boundaries.
+
+For opt-in Azure models, this bounded-history package still applies compatible request features, but omits
+`previous_response_id` because Pi does not expose an exact provider-context baseline on that path. Sending the
+identifier with a full input would duplicate history.
 
